     <P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><B><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">编者按：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">鲁家贤先生是绍兴一中</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1956</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届校友，著名乡贤、爱乡楷模。从</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1987</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年起，鲁先生就在母校设立了</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">鲁家贤奖学金</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">，用于每年奖励品学兼优的学生。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年，鲁先生及其子高央先生又出资</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">万元（分</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年实施）设立</SPAN><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">绍兴一中英贤计划</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">项目，用于支持母校引进高层次人才、奖励教学业绩优秀的教师团队和高考、竞赛成绩优异的学生，助力母校更好、更优、更有特色发展。其中，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">英贤学生奖</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">专门奖励每年在高考与竞赛中成绩优异的学生。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042009432071.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年度</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">英贤学生奖</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">已经颁发。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届一大批考取一流大学的高三毕业生获此殊荣。拿到沉甸甸的奖金（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">名校录取</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">分</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">元</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">人、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">元</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">人两档，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">竞赛获奖</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">分</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">元</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">人、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>20000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">元</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">人两档），已经在各大著名高校深造的一中学子们纷纷<B>表达了对母校老师、对鲁家贤学长的诚挚感谢和美好祝愿</B>。<B>他们在感言中，诉说一中情怀，分享大学体验，描绘青春梦想，对一中的学弟学妹们很有启发意义。</B></SPAN><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我们分批为大家奉上这些获奖者的感言，<B>既彰英贤，又启来者</B>。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042009434366.png" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">徐希彦</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">北京大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">感谢鲁家贤学长为母校绍兴一中设立的鲁家贤奖学金。获得奖励，是对我们在学习上努力的一种肯定，更是对我们人生旅程的一种激励。更令我感激的，是我的老师们，正因为有了你们的辛勤付出，才有了我们今天的收获。我将不忘初心，继续前行。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042009435493.png" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">丁颖</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">上海交通大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>    </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">很荣幸能够成为英贤奖学金的获得者，非常感谢一中母校对我的肯定。这对我来说不仅仅是一项荣誉，更是一份激励，激励我在以后的学习中继续努力，不断进步。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在高一刚刚进入一中的开学典礼上，我看到校领导们为获得各类奖学金的学长学姐们颁奖时，便也向往着某一天我也可以获得奖学金。经过三年的奋斗，我终于实现了这个目标。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">感谢母校的培养，感谢鲁家贤老学长对我们的关心，也感谢自己一路的坚持，让我最终顺利进入国家重点大学学习。我会在未来的日子里继续努力，成为有灵魂的卓越人才。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> <o:p></o:p></FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042009440497.png" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">胡乐怡</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">香港中文大学（深圳）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">很高兴时隔大半年在细雨中重新回到校园拿取属于我的奖励。一年以前的今天，恰好是第二次选考前的一天，我在图书馆中整日复习。那时我和同学坐在长椅上，望着纷飞的细雨，展望着自己的未来。第一次选考的失利给了我很大的压力，也给了我很大的动力。我不得不抓紧最后一个学期的每一分每一秒来实现弯道的超车。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">回首那段时光，我很感谢身边同学、老师、亲人的鼓励与支持，也很感谢当时的自己咬牙坚持到了最后。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">这是一场拉锯战，我们都拖拉着疲惫的身心冲向终点，只有沉下心坚持到底的人才会看见胜利的曙光。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我也想对刚刚收到高考延迟消息的学弟学妹们说：<B>这是一次考验，也是一次机会，对于当时的我来说，或许拥有更多的时间进行数学的复习，但是这也是心态的一次历练，唯有自律者才会成为一匹黑马勇往直前。加油吧，只争朝夕，不负韶华。</B></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042009442036.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">付晨阳</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">面对自己人生的第一份奖学金，有点激动，我没有像好多同学那样一直是一名佼佼者。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">从小学我就是墙角一颗不起眼的小草，成绩平平，父母也对我也没有太高的要求，所以小学我能毫无压力的快乐的学习。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">到了初中，自己觉得好像一下子长大了，可能也遇到了适合自己的老师，适合自己的班级，成绩提升的有点快。慢慢的自己也树立了考上一中的目标。在中考也算是发挥不错，以还算是不错的成绩考进了绍兴一中。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">到了高中，高一高二曾一度的有点飘飘然，再加上男孩子的好动，让我在一中那么多佼佼者中又成了一个平庸之辈。考上浙大可能是我们好多一中学子的目标，这也是我心里暗暗定下的目标。当时虽然觉得目标有点遥不可及，但是我在实际行动中从学考到选考再到高考，一步一个脚印，最终走进了浙大的校门。最让我感触深的就是高考，高考一定要保持好一个良好的心态。</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我想对学弟学妹们说，我在高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>11</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月选考完，我仍然还是在年段快</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>200</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">名的水平，但是千万别觉得时间不够了，给自己太大的压力，然后把自己压垮，最后放弃自己。希望学弟学妹们都能有自己的目标以及精神的支柱，能为了自己的追求去努力，这三个月的快乐对于你的人生来讲根本不值一提，因为当你成功之后你会发现更大的世界。<B>请你们相信，当别人在教室里聊天，而你选择去自修教室学习并一直坚持的时候，你一定能得到你所付出努力的回报。</B></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我还想分享一下大学里的生活。很多人认为大学里就轻松了，高考完自己就能放松了。但在浙大，我们面对的，更多是来自学业以及学生工作的压力。在这里每个人都不会掉以轻心，因为你比别人不努力一点，别人就能在绩点上远远地把你甩在后面。<B>我们在浙大总是调侃“恶竞”，老师布置的</B></SPAN><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3000</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">字论文，就是有人能写到</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6000</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">字甚至</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10000</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">字，他们还能在论文中用上数学模型，在历史讨论课上放出自己拍的纪录片。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">到了大学我才更真切地理解“山外有山，人外有人”的道理。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在未来我也希望我自己能保持一颗初心，去为了我自己的生活而努力，做到问心无愧，回首过去不后悔，对得起“英贤”二字。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042009443154.png" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>12</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">韦澳蕾</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">上海财经大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">很荣幸能得到这个奖金，我十分感动。感谢母校对我的重视和认可，这是我在求学路上收获的一份重要激励。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">感谢高中三年学校和老师的教育和栽培，感谢鲁家贤先生对后学晚辈的关怀。这份奖金将成为我前进路途中的一股动力，激励我不断努力，不骄不躁，认真对待学习，踏实勤奋，逐梦前行。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN><B><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></B></FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">未完待续，敬请关注！</SPAN></B></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
